  "sanchayapatra_tax": {
    "note": "Source tax on Sanchayapatra profit by the date each payout is due. \"bands\" are chosen by the holder's total Sanchayapatra investment (all schemes, paisa); \"default\" applies to schemes without their own bands. Re-check the NBR and the National Savings Directorate before releases.",
