              "max": null,
              "value": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        "basis": "Final tax. 5% when a person's total Sanchayapatra investment is up to Tk 5 lakh (2019 notification), 10% above (Income Tax Act 2023, s. 105); Pensioner Sanchayapatra up to Tk 5 lakh is exempt. Confirmed by the NBR letter to the National Savings Directorate of 3 Feb 2026.",
        "source_url": "https://bonikbarta.com/economy/9DYlnlZcrpQhy4Zz"
      },
