              "max": null,
              "value": 1000
            }
          ]
        },
        "basis": "Finance Act 2026 (passed 29 Jun 2026, amends s. 163 of the Income Tax Act 2023): a flat 10% advance tax on the profit of every Sanchayapatra, Pensioner included. It is no longer final: it counts against the year's tax in the return, and any excess is refunded.",
        "source_url": "https://www.prothomalo.com/business/economics/ifkl7ecfeo"
